PROJECT 'ISLAND' '001'
$ Island: 40 x 20 cells of 250 m, 15 m deep, with an island (land) and a 1 m
$ shoal behind it; semi-implicit DIA (QUAD IQUAD=1).
SET LEVEL 0.0 NAUTICAL
MODE STATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN
CGRID REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 10000.0 5000.0 40 20 CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 24
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 40 20 250.0 250.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'island.bot' 1 0 FREE
WIND 15.0 270.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 2.0 7.5 270.0 25.0
GEN3 KOMEN

QUAD IQUAD=1
BREAKING CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
FRICTION JONSWAP CONSTANT 0.038
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'hs.blk' LAYOUT 3 HSIGN
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'tm.blk' LAYOUT 3 TM01
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'dep.blk' LAYOUT 3 DEPTH
NUMERIC STOPC NPNTS=101 STAT MXITST=50 RESIDUAL 0 
COMPUTE
STOP
